 items and special supplies. You need to plan your strategy around the items you hold, as a single small item can decide the outcome of a battle at a critical moment. Meanwhile, over ten different professions each have distinctive talents, which play important roles in both camp development and combat.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543120/extras/55f2830fe7ca8031ecfc3c7fff7eb0b9.webp?t=1777115345\" width=615 height=53 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543120/extras/e37fa56ec5bcafbfc850ba34d54e0194.poster.avif?t=1777115345\" width=614 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543120/extras/e37fa56ec5bcafbfc850ba34d54e0194.webm?t=1777115345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543120/extras/e37fa56ec5bcafbfc850ba34d54e0194.mp4?t=1777115345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>You can modify weapons or survivors to give weapons unique traits and grant survivors bio-enhanced abilities, unlocking new effects or powers. This system is particularly crucial in the later stages of the game's combat.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543120/extras/b3ce5eb66d8576c0b4b571ddf5791390.webp?t=1777115345\" width=615 height=53 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543120/extras/6cc298607ac95ec2bcf1b95c1303de82.poster.avif?t=1777115345\" width=614 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543120/extras/6cc298607ac95e